<title>UK: SBC sets covered warrants on five U.S. companies.</title>
<headline>SBC sets covered warrants on five U.S. companies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 15 million American-style call and put covered warrants, in 15 equal tranches, on IBM Corp, McDonald's Corp, The Walt Disney Corp, Exxon Corp and Boeing Corp, lead manager SBV (Deutschland) said.</p>
<p>Each five warrants per series entitle the holder to receive the difference in marks by which the official closing price on the New York stock exchange of the common stock of the respective companies on the exercise day is higher (call) or smaller (put) than the strike price.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> IBM CORP	(US$)	 (DEM)</p>
<p> CALL A	  170.00	5.13	     20.1 PCT	9.40 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  180.00	3.90	     24.0 PCT     12.40 X</p>
<p> PUT C	   150.00	4.30	     12.3 PCT     11.20 X</p>
<p>MCDONALD'S CORP</p>
<p> CALL A	   50.00	1.50	     18.5 PCT	9.60 X</p>
<p> CALL B	   55.00	0.95	     25.5 PCT     15.10 X</p>
<p> PUT C	    45.00	1.20	     11.0 PCT     12.00 X</p>
<p>THE WALT DISNEY CORP</p>
<p> CALL A	   75.00	2.35	     15.7 PCT	9.40 X</p>
<p> CALL B	   80.00	1.75	     20.0 PCT     12.70 X</p>
<p> PUT C	    70.00	1.72		9.7 PCT     12.90 X</p>
<p>EXXON CORP</p>
<p> CALL A	  100.00	2.80		9.1 PCT     11.10 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  110.00	1.50	     15.0 PCT     20.70 X</p>
<p> PUT C	    90.00	1.15	     13.6 PCT     27.00 X</p>
<p>BOEING CORP</p>
<p> CALL A	  100.00	5.15	     11.5 PCT	6.30 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  110.00	3.60	     16.3 PCT	9.00 X</p>
<p> PUT C	    90.00	1.40	     18.2 PCT     23.20 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.JAN.97-07.JAN.98   PAYDATE	02.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
